{"version":1,"content":"<p>HOY新處境劇《你的保安李寶安》昨日（26日）首播收視報捷，最高收視高達9.4點迎接雙位數。</p><p>劇中飾演「畢好彩」的HOY一姐人氣急升，身形圓潤的她喜感十足非常入屋。</p><p>其實，她當年是𡃁模出身，當年樣子甜美、一雙修長美腿令人難忘。</p><p>身形更是Fit爆的</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:21:51.773750+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:11:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:20.552354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:20.552354+00:00","content_hash":"808ce3ddef90122035d7ae23a2229527156124b5beb922716443b53686d3173c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}